）、[[得利]] 等品牌\n- **水電材料:** 國內水電五金製造商\n\n\n## 財務概況 (單位: 百萬台幣, 只有 Margin 為 %)\n### 估值指標 (股價 $58.00 as of 2026-10-24 | TTM 截至 2026-06-30 | Forward 預估至 2026-12-31)\n| P/E (TTM) | Forward P/E | P/S (TTM) |  P/B | EV/EBITDA |\n|-----------|-------------|-----------|------|-----------|\n|     20.35 |       16.76 |      0.58 | 1.52 |     16.07 |\n\n### 年度關鍵財務數據 (近 3 年)\n|                         |   2025-12-31 |   2024-12-31 |   2023-12-31 |\n|:------------------------|-------------:|-------------:|-------------:|\n| Revenue                 |      2299.30 |      2174.73 |      1967.88 |\n| Gross Profit            |       909.05 |       836.13 |       751.94 |\n| Gross Margin (%)        |        39.54 |        38.45 |        38.21 |\n| Selling & Marketing Exp |       739.90 |       671.55 |       613.26 |\n| R&D Exp                 |       -    |       -    |       -    |\n| General & Admin Exp     |        78.87 |        73.83 |        69.60 |\n| Operating Income        |        90.27 |        90.75 |        69.08 |\n| Operating Margin (%)    |         3.93 |         4.17 |         3.51 |\n| Net Income              |        67.17 |        66.69 |        44.75 |\n| Net Margin (%)          |         2.92 |         3.07 |         2.27 |\n| Op Cash Flow            |       277.77 |       282.18 |       203.24 |\n| Investing Cash Flow     |       -51.02 |      -116.29 |      -204.95 |\n| Financing Cash Flow     |      -217.97 |      -141.23 |        43.61 |\n| CAPEX                   |       -46.01 |      -108.78 |      -197.14 |\n\n### 季度關鍵財務數據 (近 4 季)\n|                         |   2026-06-30 |   2026-03-31 |   2025-12-31 |   2025-09-30 |\n|:------------------------|-------------:|-------------:|-------------:|-------------:|\n| Revenue                 |       602.30 |       585.91 |       596.38 |       593.92 |\n| Gross Profit            |       250.04 |       242.00 |       231.53 |       230.78 |\n| Gross Margin (%)        |        41.51 |        41.30 |        38.82 |      